# Line endings: LF in the repository and, unless listed below, LF in every checkout, including
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true. Shell scripts fail on CR.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sol text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.woff2 binary

# cargo-stylus hashes these files byte for byte into the deployed programs (the `project_hash`
# section), and the deployed programs were built from a CRLF checkout. Checking them out with CRLF
# on every platform lets `cargo stylus verify` reproduce the deployments (docs/DEPLOYING.md).
contracts/stylus/*/Cargo.toml text eol=crlf
contracts/stylus/*/build.rs text eol=crlf
contracts/stylus/*/src/*.rs text eol=crlf
rust-toolchain.toml text eol=crlf
